{"id":"a90ed83c610b9875","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-mdegree-join.md","title":"直和给 many-one 度的最小上界","display":"thm-mdegree-join — 直和给 many-one 度的最小上界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-mdegree-join","aliases":["20-thm-mdegree-join"],"display":"thm-mdegree-join — 直和给 many-one 度的最小上界","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 1.6.21","source_printed_pages":[18],"source_pdf_pages":[54],"depends_on":["[[20-df-m-one-degrees]]","[[20-df-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-mdegree-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-mdegree-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mdegree-join — 直和给 many-one 度的最小上界"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 1.6.21"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8746557b9bf84a4b\" href=\"?note=8746557b9bf84a4b\" title=\"20-df-m-one-degrees\">20-df-m-one-degrees</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8746557b9bf84a4b\" href=\"?note=8746557b9bf84a4b\" title=\"20-df-m-one-degrees\">20-df-m-one-degrees</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mdegree\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}A\\le_m A\\oplus B\\land B\\le_m A\\oplus B,\\\\ A\\le_m C\\land B\\le_m C\\Longrightarrow A\\oplus B\\le_m C.\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mdegree\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}A\\le_m A\\oplus B\\land B\\le_m A\\oplus B,\\\\ A\\le_m C\\land B\\le_m C\\Longrightarrow A\\oplus B\\le_m C.\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上界由 x↦2x 与 x↦2x+1 给出。若 A、B 到 C 的见证分别为 f、g，定义 h(2x)=f(x)，h(2x+1)=g(x)；它全可计算并见证最小性。h 未必单射，因此这个证明不能用于 1 度。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 1.6.21；印刷页 18；PDF 第 54 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-m-one-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"8746557b9bf84a4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-m-one-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-m-one-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"8746557b9bf84a4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-m-one-degrees]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-m-one-degrees]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mdegree\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}A\\le_m A\\oplus B\\land B\\le_m A\\oplus B,\\\\ A\\le_m C\\land B\\le_m C\\Longrightarrow A\\oplus B\\le_m C.\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1167,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8746557b9bf84a4b","08b4fd5163a7f955"]}